<title>USA: FORECAST - API estimates, more distillate build seen.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - API estimates, more distillate build seen.</headline>
<text>
<p>(STOCKS IN THOUSAND/BBLS, CHANGES IN MLN/BBLS)</p>
<p>REUTER SURVEY ESTIMATES*	   STOCKS FOR</p>
<p>FOR WEEK ENDED 11/01/96	    WEEK ENDED 10/25/96-CHANGE</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>CRUDE.........UP 0.20 million bbls    302,349	  DN 2.526 MLN</p>
<p>DISTILLATE....UP 2.50 million bbls    117,891	  UP 3.588 MLN</p>
<p>GASOLINE......UP 0.10 million bbls    186,019	  DN 3.825 MLN</p>
<p>UTILIZATION...UP 0.10 pct pts     94.0 PCT	 UP 0.9 PCT PT</p>
<p>*NB - The survey estimate is derived by omitting the high and the low forecast and averaging the rest.</p>
</text>
